WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.560
(Door opening)

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.100
Katharine Gun?

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.980
What were you employed to do?

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.320
I translated signals intelligence and I reported anything of interest to my clients.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.500
You're a spy.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.520
Did your capacity fail?

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.799
The Americans want us to help them get a UN resolution for war.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.940
So you work for the British government?

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:39.520
No.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.360
No?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.920
This proposed war is historically unfortunate.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.720
I work for the British people.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:51.300
I do not gather intelligence so that the government can lie to the British people.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.800
Intelligence may be being manipulated to take this country to war.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:00:59.340
I could get you a copy.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.940
You're asking me to put in to a breach of the Official Secrets Act.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:05.710
Phone call that treason.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:18.180
Someone has betrayed their government and their country.

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.040
You might need our help.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.220
If we you do not go public,

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:30.680
we would be conceding that no one can ever tell the people when their government is lying.

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.680
Your marriage will be interrogated.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.620
My husband had absolutely nothing to do with this.

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:36.980
He's a Muslim.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.820
I'm sorry?

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:47.920
You chose loyalty to your country over loyalty to your government.

00:01:48.509 --> 00:01:52.398
Your marriage and yourself, I think that speaks rather highly of you.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:57.199
Katharine Louisa Gun, you're charged with an offense

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.160
at the Official Secrets Act.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.160
Do you want to risk it all?

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.920
How do you plead?

